  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>This spell transfigures the surface of an object to become extremely sticky. One object of your choice that you can see within range and that fits within a 1-foot cube adheres to anything it touches for the duration. If a creature wants to overcome the sticking effect, it can use its action to make a Strength check against your spell save DC. On a success, it can pull the target object free or remove one thing from the target object's surface.</p>\n<p><em><strong>At Higher Levels.</strong></em> When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 1st level or higher, the cube's size increases by 1 foot for each slot level above 0.</p>",
